Synthesis
---------
Perfect numbers are not merely special values of sigma; they are loops in
the aliquot dynamical graph.  The scalar fixed equation sigma(n)=2n is
usable only with divisor side channels: prime powers, parity, Mersenne
primality for the even section, and the still-missing odd-perfect packet.
